    <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;ٍﺩﺎﻳﺃ ﻰﻟﺇ ﺝﺎﺘﺤﻳ [asker_faction_name] ﻦﻣ [asker_faction_leaderTitle] [asker_nameFull]\n.[dutyDescription] ﻲﻓ ﺓﺪﻋﺎﺴﻤﻠﻟ ﺔﻴﻓﺎﺿﺇ\n\n[lendForDays] ﺓﺪﻤﻟ [asker_objective] [colonistCountToLend] ﺓﺭﺎﻋﺇ ﻚﻨﻣ ﺐﻠﻄﻳ [asker_pronoun]\n.ﻡﺎﻳﺃ\n\n[willSendShuttle]</li>
    <li>disease-&gt;ﺍﺰﻧﻮﻠﻔﻧﺇ</li>
