    <li>disease-&gt;ﺎﻳﺭﻼﻣ</li>
    <li>disease-&gt;ﻯﻭﺪﻋ</li>
    <li>questDescription(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True)-&gt;ﺹﺎﺨﺷﺃ ﻰﻟﺇ ﺝﺎﺘﺤﻳ [asker_faction_name] ﻦﻣ [asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction] [asker_nameFull]\n.[dutyRoyalDescription] ﻲﻓ ﺓﺪﻋﺎﺴﻤﻠﻟ\n\n[asker_objective] ﺔﻣﺪﺨﻟ [colonistCountToLend] ﺓﺭﺎﻋﺇ ﻚﻨﻣ ﺐﻠﻄﻳ [asker_pronoun]\n.ﻡﺎﻳﺃ [lendForDays] ﺓﺪﻤﻟ\n\n[willSendShuttle]</li>
    <li>colonistCountToLend(colonistsToLendCount==1)-&gt;[minAgeOrOlder]ﺮﻤﻌﺘﺴﻣ 1</li>
    <li>colonistCountToLend(colonistsToLendCount&gt;1)-&gt;[minAgeOrOlder]ﻦﻳﺮﻤﻌﺘﺴﻣ [colonistsToLendCount]</li>
